    "sections": {
        "description": "Auto Repair Center is a modern, responsive, and professional theme designed for auto repair shops, car service centers, vehicle maintenance providers, and automotive professionals. Ideal for showcasing services such as car repair, engine diagnostics, oil changes, tire replacement, brake services, transmission repair, battery replacement, wheel alignment, auto detailing, car inspection, and emergency roadside assistance, this theme offers a comprehensive platform to present your business effectively. With a clean, minimal, and mobile-friendly layout, it ensures a seamless user experience across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. The Auto Repair Center theme includes dedicated sections for service highlights, team profiles, client testimonials, appointment booking, and service pricing, enhancing engagement and credibility. Featuring customizable layouts, colors, and typography, it allows businesses to reflect their brand identity effortlessly. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for service sales and online bookings, and Contact Form 7 for inquiries and customer communication, this theme provides a complete solution for promoting automotive services, managing clients, and creating a professional, visually appealing, and functional online presence. Demo: https://preview.wpradiant.net/auto-repair-center/"
    },
